ans under 0.1 percent of instances moved, so the timing movement cannot be credited to the mechanism. Outcome `effective` means the assignment changed and every cell has a verified score. `environment_failure` and `unverified` say nothing about the mechanism.\n\nIf `decision.reason` is `assignment_unchanged` or `assignment_barely_changed`, the candidate in `decision` did not reach the assignment. Changing its coefficients by less than a factor of ten is rejected before submission. Use a mechanism that changes the final labels. If it is `published_start_still_ahead`, no verified candidate beats `published_start_score`; start again from the official program with a mechanism from an untried family. If it is `refine_incumbent`, the parent is the best verified candidate. If it is `explore_from_incumbent`, keep the parent's verified mechanism and add a different one.\n\nUse only the published numerical interface. Preserve the graph, optimizer, physical flow and constraints. The loss must produce a finite differentiable scalar and the decoder must produce legal binary labels. Use a general algorithm without branches keyed to the design name, seed identity, or expected timing result. Read only the text supplied in this request. The Agent will validate the returned source and submit it through the official evaluator.\n\nRead `parent_comparison` as the change from that candidate's actual parent on matched case and seed. `parent_source` identifies a published official starting measurement or a receipt from this run. Compare the largest regression, median and aggregate. Its WNS and TNS point contributions are measured before the official score floor. Check whether cut changes agree with final timing.\n\nUse `partition_change_vs_initial` and `partition_changes_vs_initial` as organizer-measured instance assignment diagnostics relative to the official initial program. Use a reported zero to distinguish identical final layer assignments from changed assignments. Treat timing movement with identical layer assignments as an observed physical difference requiring separate attribution. A missing partition diagnostic means the official artifact did not supply it. A decoder edit is run on synthetic inputs before submission: it must return integer labels 0 or 1 for every group, keep the top-die area share between 0.47 and 0.53 by itself, leave its inputs unmodified, and return labels that differ from the parent's.\n\nUse the reported failure stage, reason and bounded log excerpts as evidence. Treat `runtime_environment` failures as infrastructure observations. A confirmed `candidate_contract` failure identifies the component to repair. Keep undiagnosed failures provisional. Use `related_experiment` to see whether an earlier mechanism fixed or reproduced the issue on a comparable cell. Prefer a single change whose predicted effect can be checked in the next official evaluation.\n\n# Official numerical interface (placeholder for offline tests)\n",
